# ...except the deliberately-committed, non-secret debug signing key. Every
# machine must sign SimpleSound debug builds with the SAME key or `adb install -r`
# stops working as an update (signature mismatch -> forced uninstall -> data
# loss). Debug keystores are not secrets: the password is the well-known
# "android". See DEPLOY.md.
!keystore/simplesound-debug.keystore

# Release signing secrets, if you ever add a release variant, do NOT commit.
